// IntroString :
"P1837249430" "<color red>This mission takes place in the PvP zone of Warburg. You may encounter other hostile players during the course of this mission.</color> <br><br>If you're going to be spending time in Warburg, it's imperitive that you get a feel for the area. We've set up a number of waypoints at or near locations of interest. We'll send you to look at 5 of them."
// AcceptString :
"P3300554970" "Patrol 5 waypoints in Warburg"
// SendOffString :
"P703523271" "We've set your waypoints. Keep your eyes open, and learn the terrain of the island. <br><br>You may see villains out there. You don't have to engage them to finish the mission, but that is kind of missing the point of this zone. This is an open battle area, so you can fight villains if you want to. And remember that some villains will want to fight you. <br><br>Be careful out there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3582135062" "Go to the indicated waypoint"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P446968556" "Remember that you're just getting the lay of the land on this one. If you want to avoid fighting, you can try. But really, that's not the point."

