// IntroString :
"P2495020738" "<color red>This mission takes place in the PvP zone of Warburg. You may encounter other hostile players during the course of this mission.</color> <br><br>We must maintain a constant presence in Warburg to curb villain activities. To this end, we've set up waypoints around the zone to mark patrol routes, and are always looking for heroes to run them."
// SendOffString :
"P1977799669" "We've set your waypoints. Stay sharp. <br><br>You may see villains out there. You don't have to engage them to finish the mission, but that is kind of missing the point of this zone. This is an open battle area, so you can fight villains if you want to. And remember that some villains will want to fight you. <br><br>Be careful out there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1169072704" "There's a lot to see in Warburg, and a lot of people who'll want to make sure you don't live to see it. I'd recomend you explore more to get a feel for the area."

