// IntroString :
"P2357641462" "<color red>This mission takes place in the PvP zone of Warburg. You may encounter other hostile players during the course of this mission.</color> <br><br>Arachnos has captured one of our communication officers. We have to defeat all her captors and get her back. Doing so will not only rescue a valued agent in danger, but will also hinder the villains' efforts to gather information, decreasing the damage resistance of all villains in Warburg by 1%. I know it doesn't sound like much, but it can add up, and also offsets the villains' plans to increase their power in Warburg. <br><br>There isn't much time for this operation. You'll only have 60 minutes to rescue the communications officer and get her out."
// AcceptString :
"P32874520" "Rescue kidnapped Longbow Communications Officer"
// SendOffString :
"P2250136371" "Once you've found her, lead her out of the base to win. You only have 60 minutes. Good luck."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3562925072" "Defeat all villains in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2857362007" "You only have 60 minutes to defeat everyone in that base and get her to safety. Good luck."

