// IntroString :
"P2782593548" "<color red>This mission takes place in the PvP zone of Warburg. You may encounter other hostile players during the course of this mission.</color> <br><br>An Arachnos raiding team has stolen some new uniform-enhancement technology form one of our bases. If you can recover it, we can use it to provide a 1% bonus to damage resistance to all heroes in the Warburg Zone. I know it doesn't sound like much, but it can add up, and it also offsets the villains' attempts to undermine us. The technology will self-destruct in 60 minutes, so you won't have much time."
// AcceptString :
"P1527258352" "Defeat Arachnos raiders and recover stolen technology"
// SendOffString :
"P4232225359" "You'll have to recover the technology Arachnos stole from us, and also defeat the Raider leader and her cronies to keep the technology secret. You only have 60 minutes, so you'll have to move quickly."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P144272790" "Defeat Arachnos raiders"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4124243277" "You're running out of time to get that technology back. You must hurry!"

